You will choose, for each requirement concept, the *most-general-but-still-relevant* ancestor (MGSR) to accept for inclusion matching.

### Why
Patients may not have the specific diagnosis but may have a relevant higher-level diagnosis. We want the most general ancestor the patient might plausibly and specifically have such that the trial would still be meaningfully relevant. Avoid ancestors so generic they make almost anyone “eligible”.

